	(text "Power (blocks/1-power.md, parts list §1)\nBench 5 V terminal + test loops, bench eFuse TPS259470A (OVLO 5.35 V, ILIM 2.22 A, EN Zener),\nSMF15CA (DNP), TPS2116 priority mux (bench = VIN1) + VBUS snubber, +5V_SYS bulk,\nTPS73701 3.3 V (+3V3) and TPS73701 2.83 V terminator rail (VTERM, fed from TERMPWR).\nGlobal rails (power symbols): +5V_SYS, +3V3, VTERM, TERMPWR, GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e9c5e76f-9dfb-48d2-aacc-0ad885c174a4"))
